OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with sunny spells, isolated
OL,7,Fshowers possible in the west.
OL,8,FRemaining dry for much of the night
OL,9,Fbut cloud thickening overnight, with
OL,10,Fsome patchy light rain possible in the
OL,11,Fnorth around dawn. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,14,Fmostly light rain during the morning.
OL,15,FTurning drier during the afternoon,
OL,16,Fperhaps with some brighter spells, but
OL,17,Falso some isolated showers. Breezy,
OL,18,Fespecially on coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
